WEBVTT

00:01:58.540 --> 00:01:59.980
Roger, give me some help with the Venn gate.

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:29.300
Police, wait for the whistle.

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:43.490
Wait for the whistle.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:45.780
Quick!

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:08.730
Trevor, please. Let's get out of here quick.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.110
You're ready. Go away.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:26.320
That hog is I fell. I almost tore my arms out.

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:29.900
What do you know about?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.400
I must have seen someone firing and pushed me out of the way.

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:34.560
There.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.260
Get the ship's doctor.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:37.700
Quick.

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:38.900
Come on, Jim.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.080
I'm threatening you with the last request.

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:47.330
Yes, Roger.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:49.750
We've got horse.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:54.990
Moisture is going through this table, Father King.

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:56.990
Of course I will.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.440
All right, guys.

00:04:02.908 --> 00:04:03.588
And I'll go.

00:04:05.468 --> 00:04:07.428
Oh, I praise you to God.

00:04:08.092 --> 00:04:10.792
My mission is now in the hands to lift...

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:11.340
Thanks.

00:04:12.476 --> 00:04:13.356
Frank Rantley.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.560
He will deliver the God horse.

00:04:17.148 --> 00:04:18.148
into your hands.

00:04:19.324 --> 00:04:20.524
Russia is dying.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:34.440
Column vehicle.

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:46.900
He gave his life for mine.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:50.450
You must carry out his mission.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:53.500
Yes, sir.

00:05:02.972 --> 00:05:03.472
Cigar?

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:04.560
Thanks.

00:05:09.052 --> 00:05:11.732
I phoned you with him because I figured we could be of use to one another.

00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:16.212
Bradley's got the black stallion, and he's on his way to Sioux, John.

00:05:17.564 --> 00:05:18.384
What do you want me to do?

00:05:19.164 --> 00:05:21.364
You know your way around the island, you speak the language, don't you?

00:05:23.004 --> 00:05:24.004
Yes, but...

00:05:24.732 --> 00:05:26.352
I mean, it's already only the way you say it.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:27.840
He'll be there a week ahead of us.

00:05:28.316 --> 00:05:29.916
Sure, we had to wait for the next boat.

00:05:30.412 --> 00:05:32.972
But we can take a plane to Honolulu and a plane to Manila.

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:36.320
According to the way I figure, another hop by the plane and we'll be in Sioux Jones.

00:05:36.528 --> 00:05:37.208
That ought to be easy.

00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:39.828
We've got to beat Bradley to the High Priest Temple.

00:06:15.676 --> 00:06:17.476
We fall on our land, Bolsanaga.

00:06:18.396 --> 00:06:20.596
Our people demand that we take a new guard horse.

00:06:22.012 --> 00:06:23.272
There is no God for the...

00:06:23.324 --> 00:06:23.724
Oh, God.

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:26.340
John will have none of us.

00:06:26.716 --> 00:06:27.716
in the living embodiment.

00:06:28.988 --> 00:06:29.488
Kayong.

00:06:30.124 --> 00:06:31.844
but your people are becoming impatient.

00:06:32.524 --> 00:06:32.824
Go.

00:06:33.836 --> 00:06:35.336
Your word, the royal guard.

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:35.960
Bye.

00:06:36.204 --> 00:06:37.124
instill their patience.

00:06:53.996 --> 00:06:54.716
I present.

00:06:55.084 --> 00:06:57.864
Another still insists that the god horse is on his way.

00:06:58.732 --> 00:06:59.972
We have waited too long.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:00.840
for his return.

00:07:01.468 --> 00:07:05.488
Without him or another to take his place, a revolution is imminent.

00:07:05.948 --> 00:07:06.548
Kinso.

00:07:06.876 --> 00:07:09.376
Commander of the Royal Guard, speaks widely.

00:07:26.972 --> 00:07:28.092
a day ahead of Bradley?

00:07:28.828 --> 00:07:29.528
What's your plan?

00:07:31.212 --> 00:07:33.672
There's an old cavern just beyond those tall trees.

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:37.480
A small group of natives hold secret meetings at night.

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:40.580
You work there while I get in touch with their leader.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.300
Hello, Debois.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:10.510
You and Suzan?

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.120
Did you bring the god horse?

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:16.020
No, but I bring news which will help you accomplish your cherished desire.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:18.300
You mean...

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:20.940
The office of high priest will be yours before the next move.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:24.710
Bring your men to the old cavern tonight, and I'll explain everything.

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:29.980
The evil white man Bradley defiled your god horse.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:32.610
I'm breaking him to a saddle.

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:37.180
See, gentlemen, the guard horse is contaminated.

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:45.060
As commander of the Royal Guard, take my oath.

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:47.210
Be canoe, guard horse.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.320
It's a blood promise.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.970
He must be purged of the stallions and of the...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.840
are got installed.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:46.290
horses at the carpool, put out the royal gun!

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.200
Guard, go to meet the guard horse.

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:19.720
We must follow at a distance.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:44.880
Wahid Bradley?

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:46.430
Why yes.

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:51.710
My orders are to conduct you immediately to Tanaga at the sacred temple.

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.300
But like the god horses...

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:58.960
The royal guard will escort him safely to the sacred stable.

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:36.210
We're to wait here until the Royal Guard returns.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:36.770
Welcome, my friend. The departed Pasha has informed me of the great service you have rendered for my people.

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:40.710
I shall never be able to repay the debt I owe your countrymen for saving my life.

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:45.140
If we had known the true origin of the Black Spanian, we would have returned him at once.

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:49.440
I believe there is a saying in your language, all is well, her ends well.

00:13:08.156 --> 00:13:09.276
How is this going to help us?

00:13:09.468 --> 00:13:10.708
Patience, my friend.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.120
As soon as Tanaga's men are overpowered,

00:13:13.436 --> 00:13:14.916
The god horse will be led away.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:59.980
Thank you.

00:14:00.092 --> 00:14:01.092
Where are they picking the horse?

00:14:01.404 --> 00:14:03.644
to the forest altar for the sacrifice.

00:14:04.092 --> 00:14:07.452
But DeBoer will see to it that the horse is delivered to you as promised.

00:14:07.964 --> 00:14:08.784
Remember...

00:14:08.924 --> 00:14:11.064
The horses have no value to me if anything happened to him.

00:14:11.224 --> 00:14:12.724
Nothing will happen to him.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:13.780
Come.

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:41.060
So you see, my friend, you have really bestowed a great blessing upon my people.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:44.280
Our love for horses is as great as yours, Tanaga.

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:49.240
The God horse. The God horse.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:54.260
Tinso, take him to the forest altar.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:14:59.730
What do you mean?

00:15:01.404 --> 00:15:02.704
Some of my misguided subjects.

00:15:03.836 --> 00:15:05.096
to replace the god horse.

00:15:06.076 --> 00:15:06.376
or not.

00:15:08.092 --> 00:15:09.752
You stay here with Randy. I'll try and stay right.

00:15:09.852 --> 00:15:10.552
It's dangerous.

00:15:12.796 --> 00:15:13.436
Don't get up.

00:15:32.748 --> 00:15:34.748
Gather fuel so they all have fire.

00:15:50.444 --> 00:15:50.784
Be careful.

00:15:51.148 --> 00:15:53.628
With a tiger pit in that quail, let's go around that way.

00:15:54.988 --> 00:15:55.228
Come on.

00:15:58.668 --> 00:15:59.968
It's the black stallion.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.100
comes through the fire unharmed,

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:04.090
he will be purged of his

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:06.360
defilement. If he dies,

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.920
also Jean will know that he is

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:11.140
no longer the living embodiment

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:13.460
of Kao Keong. A new

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.440
god horse will take his place.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:39.300
...way to the forest altar.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:44.320
Trail leads to the temple.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:46.430
Bradley!

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:47.920
He must have heard about Rex.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:49.090
Quick, dear boy.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.150
Tell him they're taking the god horse up that trail.

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:58.940
The men with the god horse, have you seen them?

00:16:59.180 --> 00:16:59.980
The trail ahead...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:12.420
Nice work, dear boy. Now show us to the forest altar before it's too late.
